。它靠美国市场赚外汇，靠外汇养暴政工具、买技术、撑财政、增国力，把赚来的钱变成军力和对外扩张及对民主国家渗透控制的资本。 https://t.co/Mpkhz8A68D https://t.co/RTu28rmWce","url":"https://x.com/ShengXue_ca/status/2114783631369793974"},{"author_id":"1531801543","created_at":"2026-10-26T18:00:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114779096290852901"],"id":"2114779096290852901","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3328,"like_count":23,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":3},"text":"【山東濟南：上跨膠濟客運通道雙塔五跨式斜拉橋轉體成功】10月26日，山東省濟南市開源路上跨膠濟客運通道（含膠濟線、膠濟客運專線）雙塔五跨式斜拉橋順利完成轉體作業。項目建成後，將打破鐵路對路網的阻隔，有效提升濟南東部城區通行能力，並進一步優化城市空間布局，為區域發展注入動能。 https://t.co/ps1cGqbgdw","url":"https://x.com/PDChinese/status/2114779096290852901"},{"author_id":"55964567","created_at":"2026-10-26T17:41:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114774508972417051"],"id":"2114774508972417051","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":16379,"like_count":16,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114036603865952759","type":"quoted"}],"text":"搞笑视频\n书记说，反腐风声太紧，我们只能握握手了。\n女士回应： https://t.co/B5g2OCmF0d https://t.co/Eld32cxDmi","url":"https://x.com/wuzuolai/status/2114774508972417051"},{"author_id":"55964567","created_at":"2026-10-26T17:36:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114773052223545429"],"id":"2114773052223545429","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":2435,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":81,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114763555560145053","type":"quoted"}],"text":"为什么智慧在诚信之前？\n因为蠢人没有认知能力，愚蠢者的诚信，是不靠谱的。\n有些人看起来忠诚老实，但干起坏事来，一个顶仨\n没有认知智慧，也就是没有良知，毛迷之类多是愚忠 https://t.co/lV1fc2RPRA","url":"https://x.com/wuzuolai/status/2114773052223545429"},{"author_id":"36659991","created_at":"2026-10-26T17:25:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114770285052170355"],"id":"2114770285052170355","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2814,"like_count":10,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2114751849584603532","type":"qu